  "id": "cooperative-education",
  "term": "cooperative education",
  "definition": "In this context, cooperative education refers to Sino-foreign educational programs created as part of the internationalisation and reform of education. They are meant to support students’ academic success and development of international skills, but can be challenging when students have difficulty adapting across cultures.",
